<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
<meta charset="utf-8">
<title>WarpHold recovery kit &mdash; {{.DeviceName}}</title>
<style>
/* Every style is inline and every font is a generic family: this page must
   render and print identically on a machine with no network. */
* { box-sizing: border-box; }
body { font-family: Georgia, "Times New Roman", serif; color: #111; background: #fff;
       margin: 0; padding: 24px; line-height: 1.45; font-size: 12pt; }
main { max-width: 46em; margin: 0 auto; }
h1 { font-size: 20pt; margin: 0 0 2px; }
h2 { font-size: 12pt; margin: 0 0 6px; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: .08em; }
p { margin: 0 0 10px; }
.sub { margin: 0 0 18px; color: #444; font-size: 10pt; }
.facts { width: 100%; border-collapse: collapse; margin: 0 0 6px; font-size: 10.5pt; }
.facts th { text-align: left; width: 11em; font-weight: normal; color: #444; padding: 3px 8px 3px 0; vertical-align: top; }
.facts td { padding: 3px 0; font-family: "DejaVu Sans Mono", Consolas, monospace; word-break: break-all; }
.box { border: 1.5pt solid #111; padding: 12px 14px; margin: 0 0 16px; page-break-inside: avoid; }
.secret { font-family: "DejaVu Sans Mono", Consolas, monospace; font-size: 13pt;
          word-break: break-all; margin: 0; padding: 8px 10px; border: 1pt dashed #555; background: #f6f6f6; }
pre { font-family: "DejaVu Sans Mono", Consolas, monospace; font-size: 9.5pt; white-space: pre-wrap;
      word-break: break-all; margin: 0 0 8px; padding: 8px 10px; background: #f6f6f6; border: 1pt solid #ccc; }
.seal { border: 2pt solid #111; padding: 12px 14px; margin: 0 0 16px; font-weight: bold; page-break-inside: avoid; }
.ack { border-top: 1pt solid #111; margin-top: 22px; padding-top: 10px; font-size: 10pt; color: #333; }
.ack .line { display: inline-block; border-bottom: 1pt solid #111; width: 16em; margin: 0 1.5em 0 .4em; }
@media print { body { padding: 0; } .box, .seal { page-break-inside: avoid; } }
</style>
</head>
<body>
<main>
<h1>WarpHold recovery kit</h1>
<p class="sub">{{.DeviceName}} &middot; generated {{stamp .Generated}} &middot; keep this page offline</p>

<div class="seal">
This page is the only copy of these secrets. WarpHold does not store the repository
password anywhere it can be read back, and no one at WarpHold can recover it for you.
Print it, store it somewhere physically safe, and shred any extra copies.
</div>

<div class="box">
<h2>What to do first</h2>
<p>Install upstream Kopia on any machine, run the three commands below in order, and
your backups are back &mdash; WarpHold does not need to exist for this to work.</p>
</div>

<div class="box">
<h2>Device and repository</h2>
<table class="facts">
<tr><th>Device</th><td>{{.DeviceName}}</td></tr>
<tr><th>Device ID</th><td>{{.DeviceID}}</td></tr>
<tr><th>Storage</th><td>{{.TargetKind}}</td></tr>
{{if .Endpoint}}<tr><th>Endpoint</th><td>{{.Endpoint}}</td></tr>{{end}}
{{if .Bucket}}<tr><th>Bucket</th><td>{{.Bucket}}</td></tr>{{end}}
{{if .Region}}<tr><th>Region</th><td>{{.Region}}</td></tr>{{end}}
{{if .Prefix}}<tr><th>Prefix</th><td>{{.Prefix}}</td></tr>{{end}}
{{if .Path}}<tr><th>Path</th><td>{{.Path}}</td></tr>{{end}}
{{if .ReadKeyID}}<tr><th>Read key ID</th><td>{{.ReadKeyID}}</td></tr>{{end}}
{{if .ReadKey}}<tr><th>Read key</th><td>{{.ReadKey}}</td></tr>{{end}}
</table>
{{if .ReadKeyID}}<p class="sub">These read credentials can only read this device's backups. They cannot
write to them, delete them, or reach any other device.</p>{{end}}
</div>

<div class="box">
<h2>Repository password</h2>
<p class="sub">Kopia asks for this when you run the connect command below. Type it exactly.</p>
<p class="secret">{{.RepoPassword}}</p>
</div>

<div class="box">
<h2>Commands</h2>
{{if .Note}}<p class="sub">{{.Note}}</p>{{end}}
{{range .Commands}}<pre>{{.}}</pre>
{{end}}
<p class="sub">Replace &lt;snapshot-id&gt; with an id from <em>kopia snapshot list</em>; append a
sub-path to it (id/subdir/file) to restore just part of a snapshot.</p>
</div>

<div class="ack">
Received and stored by <span class="line"></span> on <span class="line"></span>
</div>
</main>
</body>
</html>
